 "notes": [
  "The FR4 table of the standard specification (page content updated 2026-11-20). Trace/spacing depends on the copper weight: 4/4 mil at 1 oz, 10/10 mil at 2 oz, 15/15 mil at 3 oz; inner layers of a 4-layer board 0.15 mm (6 mil).",
  "The page states 1-6 layers for this service; its thickness table also lists 8-16 layer builds, which are not checked here (see the advanced specification).",
  "Largest holes: plated 5.8 mm (larger not guaranteed), non-plated 6.3 mm (larger are milled). The check uses 6.3 mm for every round hole.",
  "Solder mask dam: 3.5 mil green, 5 mil white/black, 4 mil other colours.",
  "Not stated and therefore not checked: via pad diameter, aspect ratio, surcharge thresholds."
 ],
